---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import PageHead from '../components/PageHead.astro';
import { url } from '../lib/url';
import site from '../data/site.json';
---
<Base title="New Construction / Addition ACC Request" description="How to submit plans for a new home or addition in Knollwood Village or Braes Terrace II for Architectural Control Committee review.">
  <PageHead eyebrow="ACC request" title="New construction or addition" lead="All new construction and additions within Knollwood Village and Braes Terrace Section II must be pre-approved by the Architectural Control Committee." />
  <div class="container page-body two-col">
    <div class="prose">
      <h2 style="margin-top:0">Requirements for architectural control review</h2>
      <p>The plans you submit are reviewed for compliance with the deed restrictions for your section of Knollwood Village. You are responsible for ensuring your plans comply with all applicable deed restrictions and, separately, with City of Houston ordinances and the current building code.</p>
      <p><em>Plans must be current, correct, and representative of the work to be completed. Changes that affect the exterior size, height, or appearance of your project after your initial submission or approval must be re-submitted for review.</em></p>

      <h2>Steps</h2>
      <ol class="steps">
        <li>Read the <a href={url('/acc-faqs/')}>ACC FAQs</a> and the <a href={url('/deeds/')}>deed restrictions</a> for your section.</li>
        <li>Download the <a href={url('/docs/acc/Plan-Approval-Submission-Form.pdf')}>Plan Approval Submission Form</a> (<a href={url('/docs/acc/Plan-Approval-Submission-Form.docx')}>Word version</a>) and complete the top half.</li>
        <li>Download and print the <a href={url('/docs/acc/Construction-Site-Guidelines-and-Pledge.pdf')}>KVCC Construction Site Guidelines & Pledge of Maintenance</a>. The homeowner <strong>and</strong> the contractor or builder must review and sign it.</li>
        <li><strong>Pay the ACC review fee</strong> (see the box at right). New construction $250. Additions $150. Questions and all other submissions are free. The fee offsets the club's review costs and is not tax deductible.</li>
        <li>Email <a href={`mailto:${site.emails.build}`}>{site.emails.build}</a> with these scanned attachments:
          <ol>
            <li>Completed Plan Approval Submission Form</li>
            <li>Builder-executed (signed) Construction Site Guidelines & Pledge of Maintenance</li>
            <li>A registered PDF copy of a survey of the lot clearly showing all building setback lines and utility easements</li>
            <li>A PDF of architectural plans, drawn to scale, including a site plan, site survey, floor plans of every level, roof plan, and exterior elevations with all exterior materials indicated</li>
          </ol>
        </li>
        <li>The ACC verifies payment, reviews the documents, and responds with feedback or a signed approval letter.</li>
      </ol>
      <p>The ACC can take up to 30 days after receipt of all required documentation. You'll be notified by email if the submission is incomplete (including non-payment) or does not meet the deed restrictions. Once approved, a "KVCC Approved" yard sign can be posted on the property on request.</p>
      <p>Questions? Email the ACC at <a href={`mailto:${site.emails.build}`}>{site.emails.build}</a>.</p>
    </div>
    <aside class="aside">
      <div class="card card-soft">
        <h3>ACC review fee</h3>
        <p class="small">Checkout is handled by PayPal. You do not need a PayPal account: choose "Pay with Debit or Credit Card" on the next page. You'll get an email receipt.</p>
        <form action="https://www.paypal.com/cgi-bin/webscr" method="post" target="_top" class="stack">
          <input name="cmd" type="hidden" value="_s-xclick" />
          <input name="hosted_button_id" type="hidden" value={site.paypal.accFeeHostedButtonId} />
          <input name="on0" type="hidden" value="ACC Review fee" />
          <label for="os0">Fee type</label>
          <select name="os0" id="os0">
            <option value="New Construction">New Construction $250.00 USD</option>
            <option value="Additions">Additions $150.00 USD</option>
          </select>
          <input name="on1" type="hidden" value="Enter KVCC property address" />
          <label for="os1">Knollwood Village property address</label>
          <input maxlength="200" name="os1" id="os1" type="text" required />
          <input name="currency_code" type="hidden" value="USD" />
          <button class="btn btn-primary" type="submit">Pay review fee</button>
        </form>
        <p class="small muted" style="margin-top:.75rem">Prefer a check? Make it payable to KVCC and email <a href={`mailto:${site.emails.build}`}>{site.emails.build}</a> to arrange drop-off.</p>
      </div>
    </aside>
  </div>
</Base>
